       See the ItemGroup head comment further down for why the fix is on the PAYLOAD rather than on any
       route's copy list. A CUSTOMER WHOSE SCRIPTS WERE ALREADY DESTROYED DOES NOT GET THEM BACK; this
       stops the next loss, it recovers nothing. -->
  <ItemGroup>
